/build/
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
.env
.env.*

# ---- Textura ----
# Everything we generate stays inside the project folder, in one of these, never in /tmp or a scratchpad:
#   build/          build outputs: firmware, host renders, HIL reports, scans (upstream already ignores /build/)
#   .local/         project-local tooling: JieLi toolchain, venv, emsdk/WASI SDK, Playwright, reference material
#   .local-backup/  history bundles and backups before any rewrite
#   .private/       research: papers, notes, engine plans, classification, test plans. Never pushed.
/.local/
/.local-backup/
/.private/
# Claude Code session state (worktrees, locks, settings)
/.claude/
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
# OS and editor files
.DS_Store
._*
__MACOSX/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
# Audio is measured, never committed: commit derived numbers instead
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.aif
*.aiff
# Papers and third-party documents never go in git (they live in .private/)
*.pdf
# Build products outside build/
*.o
*.elf
*.dis
a.out
